  "description": "Bring cozy autumn charm to your creative projects with this Rustic Gingham Harvest Digital Paper Collection. This warm and inviting set includes 20 high-resolution JPG files, featuring a blend of vintage gingham textures, fall leaves, and earthy tones of orange, brown, beige, and cream. Perfect for Thanksgiving crafts, scrapbooking, farmhouse decor, wrapping paper, card making, invitations, fabric printing, and digital backgrounds, each pattern captures the nostalgic essence of the harvest season. The rustic woven textures and autumn foliage make every design feel handmade and seasonal. Each file comes in 4096 x 4096 px size, giving you crisp detail for print or digital projects. Celebrate fall creativity with this beautiful rustic collection!\n20 JPG files\n4096 X 4096 px\nHigh resolution\nInstant download\nGreat for personal & commercial use",
